    <div class="prose-shopify card mt-8">
      <h2>Campaign marketing depth: guides — campaign restraint</h2>
      <p>
<strong>Segment-By-Value Quartiles.</strong> Festival Threads Co (tour merch, $95k/mo seasonal) plans geo-segmented tour sms by venue timezone. Lesson: 3 texts per city max during sale week. Postscript ranks #1 for SMS campaign execution; Attentive #2 enterprise; Sequenzy lifecycle email layer. Campaign marketers evaluating guides — campaign restraint should map quarterly revenue moments before choosing software.</p>
