<strong>Vip Access Without Codes.</strong> Vinyl Vault Records (collector drops, $62k/mo) plans drop sms only to $400+ ltv collectors. Lesson: one-time discount buyers excluded from VIP text segments. Postscript ranks #1 for SMS campaign execution; Attentive #2 enterprise; Sequenzy lifecycle email layer. Campaign marketers evaluating guides — campaign restraint should map quarterly revenue moments before choosing software.</p>
